{"id":"2064365098970436713","kind":"article","title":"第四卷：区区现实","author":"Rob Bensinger","original_authors":["Rob Bensinger"],"original_source_urls":["https://www.readthesequences.com/Book-IV-Mere-Reality"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"理性 & 克服偏见","date":"2026-07-25","updated":"2026-10-15","votes":13,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":398,"keywords":["理性","科学哲学","认知模型","自然法则"],"summary":"导言概括本卷六个系列如何从进化与认知模型出发，探讨思维本质、自然法则及科学在个人理性中的作用；其余正文列出各系列篇目与进度。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2064365098970436713","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"O 合乎法则的真相"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"P 还原论导论"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"Q 区区现实中的喜悦"},{"id":"sec-4","level":2,"title":"R 物理主义导论"},{"id":"sec-5","level":2,"title":"S 量子物理与多世界"},{"id":"sec-6","level":2,"title":"T 科学与理性"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"9NbS2WqJ\">我们生活在一个怎样的世界？我们在这个世界上的位置是什么？在前文所述进化和认知模型运作例子的基础上，这六个系列探索了思维的本质与自然法则的特点。此外，为了应用和普及过去在科学上学到的的奥秘与简约性，这些文章提出了新的问题：科学在个人的理性当中应该扮演什么样的角色。</p><p data-pid=\"XEUlVt6F\">——<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.readthesequences.com/Biases-An-Introduction\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《偏见：序言》</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>by Rob Bensinger</p><hr/><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-18d7c31d847469817847272fe1db62aa.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"世界：导读\" data-tm-id=\"2064705136883245583\" href=\"#/post/2064705136883245583\">世界：导读</a><h2 id=\"sec-1\">O 合乎法则的真相</h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a3374aa22bc8fbbb4f4994030becacd4.png?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"合乎法则的真相\" data-tm-id=\"2065139773233182101\" href=\"#/post/2065139773233182101\">合乎法则的真相</a><h2 id=\"sec-2\">P 还原论导论</h2><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-0c2975b29f4c18989fe712ceffff35bd.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\"